      "data": {
        "value": "<p><strong>Clinical Details / Provisional Diagnosis:</strong><br>e.g., Carcinoma Cervix &ndash; Planned Radical Hysterectomy</p>\n<p><strong>Gross Examination:</strong><br>Specimen Received: (e.g., Uterus with bilateral adnexa, parametrial tissue, pelvic lymph nodes)</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Dimensions:</strong> (e.g., Uterus &ndash; 8x6x3 cm)</li>\n<li><strong>Tumor:</strong> (Presence, size, location, infiltration into surrounding tissues)</li>\n<li><strong>Lymph Nodes:</strong> (Number received, size, appearance)</li>\n<li><strong>Margins:</strong> (Whether included and identified)</li>\n<li><strong>Other Observations:</strong> (e.g., hemorrhage, necrosis)</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Microscopic Examination:</strong><br>Tumor Type: (e.g., Squamous Cell Carcinoma, Adenocarcinoma)</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Grade:</strong> (Well / Moderately / Poorly Differentiated)</li>\n<li><strong>Invasion:</strong> (Depth, lymphovascular invasion, perineural invasion)</li>\n<li><strong>Margins:</strong> (Free / Involved &ndash; specify location)</li>\n<li><strong>Lymph Nodes:</strong> (Total nodes examined, number involved)</li>\n<li>Peritumoral/Adjacent Tissue Changes</li>\n<li>Other Findings: (e.g., fibrosis, necrosis, inflammation)</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong data-start=\"1480\" data-end=\"1506\">Diagnosis / Impression:</strong></p>\n<p>Tumor Size: 3.5 x 2.8 x 1.5 cm</p>\n<p>Deep stromal invasion: Present</p>\n<p>Parametrial invasion: Absent</p>\n<p>Vaginal margin: Free of tumor</p>\n<p>Lymphovascular invasion: Present</p>\n<p>Pelvic lymph nodes (0/10): Free of tumor</p>\n<p>FIGO Staging: IB2</p>",
        "field": "textEditor"
      },
